    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—the weirdest part is that sometimes we find small things out of place, like a single box being nudged or a strap looking like it was tugged, but there's no clear reason why. it's almost like something is messing with the stacks when nobody is looking. do you think there's any common warehouse factor that causes these kinds of subtle, seemingly intentional-looking disruptions?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
